  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is about the size of an adult’s finger, silver and blue, and shines with bright light. It looks like a centipede, but soft thin hair takes the place of many pairs of legs.",
        "chapters": [
          995
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When Gu Immortals use it, they can modify their eyebrows so that every eyebrow hair can be embedded with sword path dao marks. Those dao marks amplify the power of Immortal Gu. Fang Yuan values the Gu highly in general, but at that moment he does not cultivate sword path, so he treats the gain as limited for himself.",
        "chapters": [
          995
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
